cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: BayesInteractomics
abstract: >-
  Bayesian framework for analyzing protein interactome data from
  affinity-purification mass spectrometry (AP-MS) and proximity-labeling
  experiments. Combines a deep-learning structural-interaction prior with a
  three-stream Bayesian evidence engine (enrichment, correlation, detection)
  via Bayesian model averaging to produce calibrated posterior probabilities
  for protein-protein interactions.
type: software
version: 1.2.1
